n:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >万元，比上年决算数增加</font>756.08万元，增长56.72%，具体情况如下(按项级科目分类统计)：</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  align=3Djustify  style=3D"margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋_GB2312" >（一）一般行政管理事务（</font>2011002）85.04万元，较2017年决算数减少249.8万元，减少74.6%，主要原因是人才补助经费县区由财政直接下拔。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  align=3Djustify  style=3D"margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋_GB2312" >（二）行政运行（</font>2013201）905.7万元，较2017年决算数增加263.69万元，增加41.07%，主要原因是人员增加。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  align=3Djustify  style=3D"margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><