金自评情况</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:35.2000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.2000;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >（</font>1）</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >共对</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >2018年度1个部门共计2个清单项目实施项目自评，涉及财政拨款资金共计1270万元。评价结果是&#8220;优&#8221;的项目是0个，&#8220;良&#8221;的项目是2个，&#8220;中&#8221;的项目是0个，&#8220;差&#8221;的项目是0个。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:35.2000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.2000;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >2、部门业务费绩效自评综述：根据年初设定的绩效目标，自评等次为</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >良</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >。部门业务费全年预算数为</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >619</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >万元，执行数为</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >543.94</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >万元，完成预算的</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >87.87</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >%。发现的主要问题</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >1.预算编报合理性不够高。从预算编报情况看，我部业务费619万元</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >预算金额在</font>5-100万元区间，预算安排过于零散，不利于经费的统筹管理。主要是由于为保障我部各项工作顺利开展，并提供有效的财力保障，我部财务部门广泛征求各业务科室工作开展资金需求，但未深入研究分析各项目在年内实际需支付的规模，未进行有效整合；2. 目标设定后如何科学设定考核评价标准，特别是对于不能量化的目标如何评价。 3.财务管理方面，会计核算还不够细致，对于有些能够细分的工作，未能详细分类核算，绩效评价基础数据不够精准。下一步改进措施</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >1.学习如何科学合理制定绩效目标及考核体系，充分发挥绩效工作效用。 2.针对预算编报合理性不够高问题。我部将进一步加强财务部门与业务科室的沟通交流，有针对性地合理安排年度经费预算，加大预算安排整合统筹力度，既确保有效推进工作开展，也提高财务收支管理有序平稳高效，避免挤占全市预算安排，促进发挥财政资金公共效益； 3.财务上，会计核算要更加详细，为本单位各项工作的开展、总结、评估提供有效数据资料支撑，为各项业务工作更好的开展提供帮助。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >&#9;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >&#9;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >&#9;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >&#9;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >&#9;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:楷体;mso-hansi-font-family:楷体;mso-bidi-font-family:楷体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-layout-grid-align:none;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"黑体" >七、其他重要事项说明</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:32.1500pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-layout-grid-align:none;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:楷体;font-weight:bold;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><font face=3D"楷体" >（一）机关运行经费</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-layout-grid-align:none;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-pagination:widow-or